# Placeholder manifest for the Michishirube Linux-only fork.
#
# The OS X theme (toolkit/themes/osx) is not shipped with this browser.
# This file exists so the shared reftest metadata at
# layout/reftests/reftest.list (which unconditionally includes this path)
# still parses during build backend generation. There are no OS X native
# theme tests on Linux; the harness skips this directory at run time.